window.__T__=[{"i":10120,"text":"Create a dark fantasy full-body portrait of a gothic fallen angel queen standing in a smoky burned forest at night, centered in the frame. She has enormous ragged black feathered wings spread behind her, very long straight {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"jet black\"} hair, and a mysterious featureless shadowed face hidden beneath an ornate antlered crown made of blackened metal, crystal spikes, tiny skulls, and bone-like horns. Her outfit is an elaborate {argument name=\"dress colors\" default=\"blood red and black\"} ceremonial gown with layered shredded fabric, leather-like panels, thorny armor, ribbed bodice details, long clawed gloves, dangling chains, ruby accents, skull ornaments, and many clear crystal pendants. She holds a tall necromancer staff in her left hand: a dark twisted pole topped with a crescent-shaped metal frame, a translucent crystal skull, a pointed crystal finial, hanging chains, feathers, and dangling crystal shards. Add a large crystal skull pendant at her waist and scattered crystal skulls and quartz clusters on the charred ground around her. The environment is a dense dead forest with tall black tree trunks, drifting fog, ash, tiny red embers, faint fires in the distance, wet black soil, and dramatic cold moonlit haze from the upper right. Use an ultra-detailed cinematic photoreal fantasy style, high contrast, intricate gothic jewelry, sharp textures, volumetric light rays, moody desaturated blacks and grays with glowing crimson highlights, vertical composition, imposing regal pose, ominous supernatural atmosphere.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18126.jpg"]},{"i":10121,"text":"Using REFERENCE_0 as the subject and pose reference, transform the photo into an intentionally crude hand-drawn digital doodle, like a simple MS Paint/cartoon trace made with thick uneven black lines, flat colors, minimal shading, and a plain white background. Preserve the same upper-body framing, twin braided pigtail pose with both hands holding the braids, black sleeveless top, burgundy choker with small silver charm, arm tattoo, pink nails, and the seven visible white loop hair accessories: top-left loop, forehead loop, right-top loop, and four loops down the right braid. Replace the obscured face with a playful cartoon face: oversized angular wraparound sunglasses, closed smiling eyes, open mouth, and tongue sticking out. Remove the concrete wall and street background completely. Make the result look deliberately imperfect, loose, funny, and hand-drawn rather than polished.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18127.jpg"]},{"i":10122,"text":"Using the provided iPhone Photos screenshot as the reference, recreate it as a cleaner, high-fidelity synthetic screenshot while preserving the same overall content: the cloud photo, the Photos app metadata panel, the map, date/time, filename, camera details, and bottom controls. Subtly rebuild the cloud image rather than copying it exactly, with a slightly wider-feeling crop, sharper modern rendering, and a more polished dark iOS interface. Keep the visible text and metadata unchanged, including {argument name=\"date and time\" default=\"Sunday • Sep 3, 2017 • 9:13 PM\"}, {argument name=\"filename\" default=\"IMG_2139\"}, {argument name=\"device name\" default=\"Apple iPhone 7 Plus\"}, {argument name=\"location\" default=\"Del Valle\"}, and {argument name=\"photo specs\" default=\"Telephoto Camera — 56 mm ƒ2.8; 12 MP • 4032 × 3024 • 1.6 MB; ISO 20; 57 mm; 0 ev; ƒ2.8; 1/618 s\"}. Include exactly 5 bottom toolbar icons: share, heart, information, adjustment sliders, and trash. Keep the map section with the centered photo-pin thumbnail and the visible road shields 71 Texas, 183 toll, 45 toll, and 130 toll.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18128.jpg"]},{"i":10123,"text":"Create a highly detailed surreal architectural fantasy scene titled {argument name=\"artwork title\" default=\"The Covenant of the Unfinished\"}: an immense biomorphic ivory structure with smooth flowing walls, hollow oval openings, and sculptural arches curves through a misty dreamlike interior landscape. The setting blends futuristic sacred architecture, Art Nouveau organic forms, and celestial cartography. On the left, glowing golden trees and delicate plants grow inside and around large rounded alcoves, with amber glass-like orbs embedded in the walls and floating among branches. A dark reflective water channel winds through the center foreground, crossed by thin luminous gold lines like star charts and orbital paths. On the right, a broad circular white stone platform with a recessed pool or void sits above the water, while towering vertical columns and translucent curtain-like panels rise into smoky darkness. Fill the air with fine golden geometric overlays: concentric circles, arcs, constellation dots, vertical plumb lines, delicate grids, and suspended pendulum-like droplets. Use a palette of {argument name=\"main color palette\" default=\"warm ivory, antique gold, deep teal gray, smoky charcoal, and soft mist white\"}, with dramatic diffused light streaming from the upper left, glowing highlights, atmospheric fog, and reflective wet surfaces. The mood should feel {argument name=\"mood\" default=\"mystical, unfinished, sacred, and quietly apocalyptic\"}. Render as a vertical cinematic digital painting with ultra-fine detail, elegant composition, soft volumetric haze, luminous particles, and no people, no readable text, no modern signage.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18130.jpg"]},{"i":10124,"text":"{\"type\":\"clean corporate visual identity system presentation board\",\"style\":\"premium minimalist brand guideline page, white background, thin light-gray divider lines, precise grid layout, editorial typography, black and vivid orange accents, subtle shadows, InDesign-style brand manual, high resolution\",\"brand\":{\"name\":\"{argument name=\\\"brand name\\\" default=\\\"Shynloc\\\"}\",\"system title\":\"{argument name=\\\"system title\\\" default=\\\"SHYNLOC VISUAL IDENTITY SYSTEM\\\"}\",\"page label\":\"PAGE 01\",\"theme\":\"AI-driven folded N logo concept\"},\"layout\":{\"canvas\":\"portrait A4 brand guideline sheet with generous margins\",\"top bar\":{\"count\":3,\"items\":[\"left header text: SHYNLOC VISUAL IDENTITY SYSTEM\",\"thin horizontal rule across the page\",\"right page marker: PAGE 01 with 01 in orange\"]},\"hero section\":{\"position\":\"upper half\",\"title\":\"BRAND IDENTITY\",\"subtitle\":\"Logo Concept\",\"right tagline\":\"AI-DRIVEN FOLDED N with a small orange slash mark\",\"main logo\":\"large centered primary wordmark reading {argument name=\\\"primary logo text\\\" default=\\\"ShyNloc\\\"}; black italic rounded script letters, with the central N replaced by a sharp origami folded orange symbol; the folded N uses angular facets, gradients from deep orange to golden yellow, and crisp triangular planes\"},\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"PRIMARY LOGO\",\"position\":\"center divider label above lower content\",\"count\":1,\"labels\":[\"large primary ShyNloc wordmark\"]},{\"title\":\"SYMBOL MARK\",\"position\":\"lower left large panel\",\"count\":1,\"labels\":[\"standalone folded orange N mark with subtle gray shadow\"]},{\"title\":\"CONCEPT DIAGRAM\",\"position\":\"lower right upper panel\",\"count\":3,\"labels\":[\"gray letter N labeled LETTER N IDENTITY\",\"gray AI labeled ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE\",\"orange folded N symbol labeled FOLDED N AI-DRIVEN\"],\"diagram text\":\"N + AI = folded N symbol\"},{\"title\":\"CONCEPT\",\"position\":\"beneath concept diagram\",\"count\":1,\"labels\":[\"paragraph explaining the logo concept\"]},{\"title\":\"COLOR PALETTE\",\"position\":\"bottom left panel\",\"count\":2,\"labels\":[\"Onyx Black #0A0A0A\",\"Shynloc Orange gradient #FF7A00 – #FFB400\"],\"swatches\":\"one black rectangle and one orange gradient rectangle divided into warm orange bands\"},{\"title\":\"CONSTRUCTION\",\"position\":\"bottom right panel\",\"count\":1,\"labels\":[\"geometric construction drawing of the ShyNloc logo\"],\"details\":\"gray wordmark overlaid with orange construction lines on the folded N, dotted guides, bounding boxes, diagonal guide lines, and two 45° angle labels\"}],\"footer\":{\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"small black square containing orange folded N icon\",\"text block: SHYNLOC VISUAL IDENTITY SYSTEM\",\"text block: VERSION 1.0 / MAY 2024\",\"text block: DESIGNED FOR THE FUTURE. DRIVEN BY INTELLIGENCE. with orange slash at far right\"]}},\"typography\":{\"headings\":\"uppercase geometric sans serif, wide tracking\",\"body\":\"small condensed sans serif, precise corporate guideline copy\",\"wordmark\":\"custom bold italic rounded script for the black letters\"},\"colors\":{\"background\":\"warm white\",\"primary black\":\"{argument name=\\\"black color hex\\\" default=\\\"#0A0A0A\\\"}\",\"primary orange\":\"{argument name=\\\"orange color hex\\\" default=\\\"#FF7A00\\\"}\",\"gold highlight\":\"#FFB400\",\"divider gray\":\"#D8D8D8\",\"diagram gray\":\"#B8B8B8\"},\"concept paragraph\":\"The Shynloc logo centers on a bold folded N that intelligently integrates the essence of AI. The lower diagonal fold forms an A, while the vertical stroke completes the I, creating a forward-looking mark that communicates innovation, intelligence, and precision. Origami-inspired geometry reflects adaptability, engineering, and future-ready thinking.\",\"rendering notes\":\"make all text crisp and legible, align everything to a strict grid, use subtle orange gradient facets on the folded N, keep the page uncluttered and luxurious, no mockup perspective, flat front-facing presentation board\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18131.jpg"]},{"i":10125,"text":"{\"type\":\"vertical fashion outfit breakdown poster / social media infographic\",\"language\":\"Chinese text on the design\",\"canvas\":\"tall 9:16 mobile poster with rounded corners, soft cream background, pale olive-green accents, hand-drawn hearts, stars, paperclip and marker doodles, clean magazine collage aesthetic\",\"main_title\":\"{argument name=\\\"day title\\\" default=\\\"DAY 2 周二｜运动活力风\\\"}\",\"profile_bar\":\"{argument name=\\\"profile text\\\" default=\\\"亚希娜｜22岁｜173cm｜62kg｜运动型身材\\\"}\",\"top_note\":\"{argument name=\\\"challenge note\\\" default=\\\"7天穿搭挑战\\\"}\",\"centerpiece\":{\"subject\":\"full-body street fashion photo of a young woman standing outdoors in a bright modern colonnade\",\"pose\":\"relaxed standing pose, one hand holding the strap of a black drawstring gym bag, wearing a black baseball cap\",\"outfit\":\"all-black sporty activewear: fitted short-sleeve cropped athletic T-shirt, high-waisted sculpting leggings, black drawstring gym bag, white crew athletic socks, chunky white-gray running shoes\",\"mood\":\"energetic, clean, confident, everyday gym-to-street styling\"},\"layout\":{\"left_callouts\":{\"count\":5,\"style\":\"rounded white labels connected to the outfit by dotted leader lines\",\"items\":[{\"label\":\"上衣\",\"description\":\"速干短款\\n运动T恤\",\"price\":\"￥119\"},{\"label\":\"裤子\",\"description\":\"高腰塑形\\n运动裤\",\"price\":\"￥179\"},{\"label\":\"包包\",\"description\":\"健身抽绳包\",\"price\":\"￥99\"},{\"label\":\"袜子\",\"description\":\"运动中筒袜\",\"price\":\"￥29\"},{\"label\":\"鞋子\",\"description\":\"缓震跑鞋\",\"price\":\"￥299\"}]},\"right_accessory_panel\":{\"title\":\"配饰细节\",\"count\":5,\"style\":\"stacked rounded photo cards with small captions and prices\",\"items\":[{\"label\":\"运动手表\",\"price\":\"\"},{\"label\":\"小耳钉\",\"price\":\"￥39\"},{\"label\":\"发圈\",\"price\":\"￥15\"},{\"label\":\"帽子\",\"description\":\"棒球帽\",\"price\":\"￥79\"},{\"label\":\"挂件\",\"description\":\"运动水壶挂件\",\"price\":\"￥35\"}]},\"bottom_style_notes\":{\"title\":\"搭配思路\",\"count\":3,\"bullets\":[\"黑色修身短T勾勒上身线条，短款设计显高显比例，突出腰线，拉长腿部视觉。\",\"高腰塑形运动裤贴合曲线，弹力面料包裹性好，修饰臀腿，显腿直显长，适合高挑身材。\",\"整体黑灰基础色，简约干净，运动感十足，显活力又高级，日常健身或出街都超合适。\"]}},\"typography\":\"large bold serif DAY number, mixed Chinese sans-serif labels, olive-green price text, black body copy, editorial hierarchy\",\"image_treatment\":\"realistic fashion photography blended into a scrapbook-style infographic; keep the model face softly blurred or anonymized\",\"color_palette\":\"black activewear, white shoes and socks, cream background, muted olive green accents, small pink heart highlights\",\"constraints\":\"make every label legible, preserve the exact count of 5 left outfit callouts, 5 accessory detail items, and 3 bottom styling notes; no extra products or unrelated UI elements\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18132.jpg"]},{"i":10126,"text":"{\"type\":\"vertical Chinese fashion outfit infographic poster\",\"style\":\"clean Xiaohongshu-style editorial layout, soft beige and blush pink palette, rounded cards, dotted callout leader lines, small hearts, sparkle doodles, paper clip sticker, elegant magazine typography\",\"canvas\":{\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"background\":\"bright minimalist indoor room with large window, cream walls, soft daylight, pale floor\"},\"header\":{\"main_title\":\"DAY 1\",\"subtitle\":\"周一｜通勤清爽风\",\"challenge_badge\":\"7天穿搭挑战\",\"profile_bar\":\"{argument name=\\\"profile bar text\\\" default=\\\"亚希娜 | 22岁 | 173cm | 62kg | 运动型身材\\\"}\"},\"main_subject\":{\"description\":\"full-body fashion model standing relaxed in the center, face softly blurred or anonymized, long black hair, slim athletic build, one hand holding hair, one hand in trouser pocket\",\"outfit\":\"commuter outfit with a fitted white square-neck short-sleeve knit top, high-waisted light gray straight-leg trousers, brown belt, white mid-calf socks, black leather loafers with gold hardware, black large tote bag, small necklace, square brown leather watch, small silver earrings\",\"mood\":\"fresh, neat, comfortable, office-commute appropriate\"},\"layout\":{\"centerpiece\":\"large full-body outfit photo occupying most of the poster\",\"left_callouts\":{\"count\":4,\"items\":[{\"label\":\"上衣\",\"text\":\"修身针织短袖\\n简约显身材\\n￥129\",\"points_to\":\"white fitted knit top\"},{\"label\":\"裤子\",\"text\":\"高腰直筒西装裤\\n显高显腿长\\n￥199\",\"points_to\":\"gray straight-leg trousers\"},{\"label\":\"包包\",\"text\":\"通勤托特包\\n大容量有型\\n￥189\",\"points_to\":\"black tote bag\"},{\"label\":\"袜子\",\"text\":\"中筒纯白袜\\n清爽百搭\\n￥19.9\",\"points_to\":\"white mid-calf socks\"}]},\"right_accessory_panel\":{\"title\":\"配饰\",\"count\":3,\"items\":[{\"image\":\"close-up crop of necklace on white square-neck top\",\"text\":\"项链：简约小吊坠\\n气质百搭｜￥59\"},{\"image\":\"close-up crop of brown leather square watch on wrist\",\"text\":\"手表：小方表盘\\n简约气质｜￥159\"},{\"image\":\"close-up crop of ear with small silver earring\",\"text\":\"耳钉：小巧银色\\n低调精致｜￥39\"}]},\"right_callouts\":{\"count\":3,\"items\":[{\"label\":\"鞋子\",\"text\":\"乐福鞋\\n经典百搭\\n￥199\",\"points_to\":\"black loafers\"},{\"label\":\"帽子\",\"text\":\"无\",\"icon\":\"small pink hat doodle\"},{\"label\":\"挂件\",\"text\":\"无\",\"icon\":\"pink heart doodle\"}]},\"bottom_note_card\":{\"title\":\"搭配\\n思路\",\"count\":3,\"bullet_icon\":\"pink heart\",\"bullets\":[\"修身针织短袖勾勒上身线条，展现健康紧致的运动型身材。\",\"高腰直筒西装裤拉长腿部比例，显高显瘦，通勤利落有气场。\",\"灰白基础色系清爽干净，搭配黑色配饰，简约高级不出错。\"]}},\"text_rendering\":\"All visible Chinese text should be crisp and readable, with prices in soft pink. Use neat alignment, rounded white text boxes, thin dotted connector lines, and a polished social-media fashion guide look.\",\"customization\":\"Keep the outfit concept as {argument name=\\\"outfit theme\\\" default=\\\"Monday fresh commuter style\\\"}; use {argument name=\\\"model description\\\" default=\\\"22-year-old tall athletic woman with long black hair\\\"}; emphasize {argument name=\\\"color palette\\\" default=\\\"white, light gray, black, brown, blush pink, warm beige\\\"}.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18133.jpg"]},{"i":10127,"text":"{\"type\":\"vertical Chinese fashion outfit infographic poster\",\"format\":\"mobile social media style guide, 9:16, soft magazine layout\",\"headline\":\"DAY 3 | 周三 | 法式约会风\",\"challenge_badge\":\"7天穿搭挑战\",\"model\":{\"name\":\"{argument name=\\\"character name\\\" default=\\\"亚希娜\\\"}\",\"stats\":\"22岁 | 173cm | 62kg | 运动型身材\",\"appearance\":\"young East Asian woman with long loose black hair, delicate makeup, pearl earrings, graceful romantic expression\",\"pose\":\"full-body standing pose in a bright apartment by a tall window, one hand holding a shoulder bag strap, the other holding a cream beret\"},\"outfit\":{\"style\":\"{argument name=\\\"outfit style\\\" default=\\\"French romantic date outfit\\\"}\",\"palette\":\"{argument name=\\\"color palette\\\" default=\\\"warm milky cream and soft blush pink\\\"}\",\"main_items_count\":5,\"main_items\":[{\"label\":\"上衣\",\"description\":\"方领针织上衣\",\"price\":\"¥159\",\"callout_position\":\"left upper\",\"connector\":\"black dotted line to the cream square-neck ribbed knit top\"},{\"label\":\"下装\",\"description\":\"高腰A字半身裙\",\"price\":\"¥189\",\"callout_position\":\"left middle\",\"connector\":\"black dotted line to the high-waisted blush pink A-line midi skirt\"},{\"label\":\"包包\",\"description\":\"迷你腋下包\",\"price\":\"¥199\",\"callout_position\":\"left lower-middle\",\"connector\":\"black dotted line to the small cream underarm shoulder bag\"},{\"label\":\"袜子\",\"description\":\"蕾丝袜\",\"price\":\"¥25\",\"callout_position\":\"left bottom\",\"connector\":\"black dotted line to white lace ankle socks\"},{\"label\":\"鞋子\",\"description\":\"绑带低跟凉鞋\",\"price\":\"¥239\",\"callout_position\":\"right bottom\",\"connector\":\"black dotted line to champagne-gold strappy low-heel sandals\"}],\"accessory_sections_count\":2,\"accessory_sections\":[{\"title\":\"配饰细节可展示\",\"position\":\"right upper vertical card\",\"items_count\":3,\"items\":[{\"label\":\"珍珠耳环\",\"price\":\"¥69\",\"image\":\"close-up crop of pearl drop earrings on ear\"},{\"label\":\"细项链\",\"price\":\"¥59\",\"image\":\"close-up crop of a delicate necklace at the collarbone\"},{\"label\":\"手链\",\"price\":\"¥49\",\"image\":\"close-up crop of a thin bracelet on wrist\"}]},{\"title\":\"帽子与挂件\",\"position\":\"right middle stacked cards\",\"items_count\":2,\"items\":[{\"label\":\"帽子\",\"description\":\"奶油贝雷帽\",\"price\":\"¥89\",\"image\":\"cream beret product crop\"},{\"label\":\"挂件\",\"description\":\"蝴蝶结挂件\",\"price\":\"¥35\",\"image\":\"cream bow charm product crop\"}]}]},\"bottom_notes\":{\"title\":\"搭配思路\",\"notes_count\":3,\"notes\":[\"温柔奶油色系，法式浪漫感拉满，温柔显气质。\",\"高腰A字裙拉长比例，露脚踝 + 低跟鞋，显高显腿长。\",\"约会必备穿搭，精致细节加分，甜而不腻，氛围感满分。\"]},\"design\":{\"background\":\"bright cozy interior with tall window, soft daylight, pale walls, small side table with flowers, clean cream paper texture\",\"layout\":\"central full-body model photograph framed by rounded rectangle, product callout cards around both sides, dotted connector lines, bottom note card like scrapbook paper\",\"graphics\":\"pink hearts, small sparkles, paperclip sticker at bottom left, rounded white cards with blush shadows\",\"typography\":\"large elegant serif English DAY 3 mixed with Chinese sans-serif labels, soft rose price text\",\"mood\":\"gentle, romantic, feminine, polished, Xiaohongshu fashion guide aesthetic\"},\"negative_prompt\":\"avoid dark lighting, harsh contrast, cluttered background, distorted hands, unreadable labels, wrong item count, extra people, aggressive cyberpunk or streetwear style\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18134.jpg"]},{"i":10128,"text":"{\"type\":\"futuristic smartphone launch advertisement poster\",\"brand\":\"{argument name=\\\"brand name\\\" default=\\\"xiaomi\\\"}\",\"product\":\"{argument name=\\\"product name\\\" default=\\\"17 Pro\\\"}\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"vertical 2:3 poster\",\"visual_style\":\"premium tech fashion advertising, glossy studio lighting, lavender and graphite monochrome palette, shallow depth of field, crisp product render blended with fashion photography, clean white typography, subtle HUD interface lines\",\"scene\":{\"background\":\"soft purple-gray gradient studio backdrop with huge translucent oversized numerals reading 17 Pro behind the subject, faint interface dots and thin horizontal UI lines near the top right and bottom edge\",\"human_model\":\"young fashion model standing in three-quarter profile on the left, very long thick braided hair colored {argument name=\\\"hair color\\\" default=\\\"lavender purple\\\"}, wearing a fitted cropped long-sleeve turtleneck top in muted lavender and dark gray cargo pants with pocket details, one arm extended toward camera holding the phone; face intentionally covered by a large square pixelated blur block in muted skin tones\",\"phone\":{\"position\":\"dominant foreground on the right, held close to camera in the model's hand\",\"color\":\"{argument name=\\\"phone color\\\" default=\\\"deep smoky purple\\\"}\",\"design\":\"ultra-slim rectangular smartphone with rounded corners, satin matte back, metallic rim, small xiaomi logo near lower back\",\"camera_module\":\"large glossy rounded-rectangle camera island at top, two black camera lenses stacked vertically on the left, a large circular secondary display on the right showing a minimal analog clock hand graphic in violet glow, tiny LEICA text and flash below the module\"},\"layout\":{\"headline\":{\"position\":\"top left\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"headline text\\\" default=\\\"xiaomi 17 Pro\\\"}\",\"style\":\"lowercase xiaomi in white bold sans-serif followed by 17 Pro\"},\"callouts\":{\"count\":3,\"style\":\"thin white technical leader lines with small dot endpoints\",\"labels\":[{\"text\":\"Leica Camera System\",\"position\":\"upper right of phone, line points to the camera lens\"},{\"text\":\"Secondary Display Integration\",\"position\":\"mid-right, line points to the secondary display/camera island\"},{\"text\":\"Ultra-Slim Premium Design\",\"position\":\"lower right, line points to the phone edge and hand\"}]},\"feature_card\":{\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"count\":4,\"style\":\"translucent frosted-glass rounded rectangle with pale lavender border, white text, small line icons\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"microchip\",\"label\":\"Flagship Performance\"},{\"icon\":\"AI square\",\"label\":\"Advanced AI Imaging\"},{\"icon\":\"lightning bolt in circle\",\"label\":\"Fast Charging\"},{\"icon\":\"connected nodes\",\"label\":\"Next-Gen Xiaomi AI\"}]},\"decorative_elements\":\"small pale purple navigation dots, micro line accents, and subtle tech UI ornaments around the poster\"},\"lighting\":\"soft diffused key light from upper left, reflective highlights on phone glass and metal rim, gentle shadows on hand and clothing\",\"composition\":\"phone is the largest focal element occupying right-center, model body creates diagonal fashion silhouette on the left, feature card overlaps lower-left body area, typography remains clean and readable\",\"rendering_instructions\":\"create a polished commercial poster, high resolution, realistic hands and phone, premium Leica-style camera branding, no extra sections beyond the 3 callout labels and the 4 feature-card items\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18135.jpg"]},{"i":10129,"text":"{\"type\":\"premium smartphone launch advertisement poster\",\"format\":\"vertical 2:3 product marketing visual\",\"headline\":\"{argument name=\\\"headline text\\\" default=\\\"xiaomi 17 Pro\\\"}\",\"scene\":{\"background\":\"soft studio backdrop with pale lavender-to-white gradient, oversized blurred abstract letters behind the subject, clean high-tech atmosphere\",\"lighting\":\"diffused commercial studio lighting with gentle highlights and soft shadows\",\"color_palette\":\"lavender, silver, white, charcoal black, muted olive gray\"},\"main_subject\":{\"description\":\"fashion model from upper thighs to head, standing in a dynamic pose and holding a large smartphone toward the camera\",\"appearance\":\"long lavender-purple box braids, lavender fitted long-sleeve top, loose olive-gray cargo pants\",\"face\":\"face covered by a centered soft-edged square blur censor block in muted mauve, obscuring facial details\",\"pose\":\"one arm extended forward presenting the phone, body slightly leaning, confident product-demo posture\"},\"product\":{\"name\":\"{argument name=\\\"phone model\\\" default=\\\"Xiaomi 17 Pro\\\"}\",\"position\":\"dominant foreground, tilted diagonally from lower right toward upper left, back side facing viewer\",\"finish\":\"{argument name=\\\"phone color\\\" default=\\\"lavender purple satin metallic\\\"}\",\"design\":\"ultra-slim rounded rectangular body with polished edges\",\"rear_module\":\"large black rectangular camera island in the top-left corner with two prominent circular camera lenses, a small flash, Leica branding, and a square secondary display\",\"secondary_display\":\"black rounded-square screen showing a purple analog clock face with minimalist white hands\",\"branding\":\"subtle vertical Xiaomi-style logo near the lower back of the phone\"},\"layout\":{\"brand_text\":{\"count\":1,\"position\":\"top left\",\"text\":\"xiaomi 17 Pro\",\"style\":\"bold black lowercase xiaomi wordmark with lighter Pro text\"},\"callouts\":{\"count\":3,\"style\":\"translucent frosted-glass rounded rectangles with thin white connector lines and small purple anchor dots\",\"items\":[{\"label\":\"Leica Camera System\",\"position\":\"left middle\",\"points_to\":\"rear camera lenses\"},{\"label\":\"Secondary Display Integration\",\"position\":\"right upper middle\",\"points_to\":\"secondary clock display\"},{\"label\":\"Ultra-Slim Premium Design\",\"position\":\"left lower middle\",\"points_to\":\"thin phone body edge\"}]},\"feature_panel\":{\"count\":4,\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"style\":\"large translucent frosted-glass rounded rectangle\",\"items\":[\"Flagship Performance\",\"Advanced AI Imaging\",\"Fast Charging\",\"Next-Gen Xiaomi AI\"]}},\"typography\":\"modern clean sans-serif, black text on frosted glass panels, high readability\",\"rendering_style\":\"photorealistic commercial product photography blended with polished tech-ad graphic overlays, crisp focus on the phone, shallow depth of field on background and model\",\"quality\":\"high-resolution, premium flagship smartphone campaign, glossy but minimal, no extra logos beyond the visible Xiaomi and Leica-style markings\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18136.jpg"]},{"i":10130,"text":"{\"type\":\"minimal luxury signature style selection poster\",\"canvas\":\"square 1:1 format on warm off-white paper background with subtle vignette, soft shadows, elegant editorial spacing\",\"headline\":\"{argument name=\\\"headline text\\\" default=\\\"SEREIN · SIGNATURE STYLE SELECTION\\\"}\",\"subtitle\":\"Different strokes, different presence.\",\"bottom_caption\":\"选一个，作为你的专属签名。\",\"name_to_sign\":\"{argument name=\\\"signature name\\\" default=\\\"Serein\\\"}\",\"typography\":\"wide letter-spaced uppercase serif headline, tiny refined sans-serif labels, understated premium stationery aesthetic\",\"layout\":{\"structure\":\"two-column by three-row grid of six rounded white signature cards, each card with faint border, soft drop shadow, generous padding, and one black handwritten signature centered prominently\",\"card_count\":6,\"cards\":[{\"number\":\"01\",\"position\":\"top left\",\"label\":\"MINIMAL · REFINED\",\"accent_color\":\"muted blue-gray dash\",\"signature_style\":\"very thin minimalist cursive line, long horizontal entry and exit strokes, calm and refined\"},{\"number\":\"02\",\"position\":\"top right\",\"label\":\"BOLD · EXPRESSIVE\",\"accent_color\":\"warm gold dash\",\"signature_style\":\"large bold angular cursive, thick black strokes, dramatic upward sweep ending in a long rising flourish to the upper right\"},{\"number\":\"03\",\"position\":\"middle left\",\"label\":\"CASUAL · EFFORTLESS\",\"accent_color\":\"olive green dash\",\"signature_style\":\"loose casual flowing handwriting, oversized initial capital, relaxed thin pen pressure and long trailing underline\"},{\"number\":\"04\",\"position\":\"middle right\",\"label\":\"EASTERN · FLOWING\",\"accent_color\":\"soft brown dash\",\"signature_style\":\"brush-pen inspired calligraphic signature with textured ink, dynamic thick-to-thin strokes, airy fading tail\"},{\"number\":\"05\",\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"label\":\"SHARP · STRUCTURED\",\"accent_color\":\"slate blue dash\",\"signature_style\":\"sharp geometric signature, lightning-like angular initial, structured slanted letters, precise straight underline\"},{\"number\":\"06\",\"position\":\"bottom right\",\"label\":\"EXPERIMENTAL · ARTISTIC\",\"accent_color\":\"dark navy dash\",\"signature_style\":\"abstract artistic signature with looping overlapping flourishes, sketch-like strokes, expressive scribble energy and long fine baseline\"}]},\"visual_style\":\"black ink on clean white cards, high-end brand presentation, restrained monochrome palette with tiny colored accent marks, realistic paper texture, crisp vector-like typography, photoreal soft ambient lighting\",\"rendering_instructions\":\"Create a polished signature selection sheet where the same customizable name appears in all six distinct handwritten styles. Keep the signatures legible but authentically handwritten, with natural ink variation and no extra objects.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18137.jpg"]},{"i":10131,"text":"{\"type\":\"colorful illustrated tourist map poster\",\"format\":\"vertical A4 travel guide infographic\",\"language\":\"Japanese\",\"headline\":\"{argument name=\\\"headline text\\\" default=\\\"初めての香港観光マップ\\\"}\",\"subheadline\":\"繁華街・観光スポットがひと目でわかる！\",\"style\":\"bright friendly Japanese travel-magazine design, hand-drawn vector map, rounded cards, cute icons, thick outlines, pastel sea, green islands, lively but clean layout, highly legible print poster\",\"map\":{\"destination\":\"{argument name=\\\"destination\\\" default=\\\"Hong Kong\\\"}\",\"view\":\"simplified illustrated regional map across blue ocean with three main landmasses and dotted transit routes\",\"main area labels\":{\"count\":4,\"labels\":[\"九龍エリア\",\"香港島エリア\",\"ランタオ島\",\"ビクトリア・ハーバー\"]},\"routes\":\"red dotted MTR route with station dots and transfer marks, purple dotted route around the harbor, blue dashed ferry/airport express routes, small boat icons on the water\",\"compass\":\"small north compass in the top right\"},\"left legend\":{\"position\":\"upper left\",\"title\":\"icon legend\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"繁華街 shopping bag neon icon\",\"観光スポット camera and icon mark\",\"絶景スポット starry night icon\",\"家族向け Ferris wheel and green icon\"]},\"transport callout\":{\"position\":\"left middle\",\"title\":\"エアポートエクスプレス\",\"description\":\"airport to Hong Kong by train, about 24 minutes, with white-and-blue train illustration\"},\"attraction cards\":{\"total count\":20,\"kowloon area cards\":{\"count\":6,\"cards\":[\"旺角（モンコック） neon shopping district\",\"女人街（レディース街） market\",\"廟街（テンプルストリート） night market\",\"油麻地 local streets\",\"佐敦（ジョーダン） dim sum area\",\"尖沙咀（チムサーチョイ） sightseeing and night-view center\"]},\"victoria harbor and east cards\":{\"count\":4,\"cards\":[\"星光大道 avenue of stars and skyline\",\"西九龍文化地区 art and culture\",\"M+ art museum\",\"高鉄香港西九龍駅 high-speed rail station\"]},\"hong kong island cards\":{\"count\":5,\"cards\":[\"上環 old streets\",\"中環（セントラル） finance and sightseeing base\",\"湾仔 nostalgic gourmet area\",\"銅鑼湾 large shopping area\",\"太平山頂（ビクトリア・ピーク） night-view spot with tram\"]},\"lantau island cards\":{\"count\":5,\"cards\":[\"香港国際空港\",\"香港ディズニーランド family destination\",\"昂坪360 ropeway\",\"天壇大仏 scenic spot\",\"スター・フェリー乗り場 harbor transport\"]}},\"bottom recommendation panels\":{\"position\":\"bottom row\",\"count\":4,\"panels\":[\"1 まず行くなら: 尖沙咀・中環・ビクトリアピーク with skyline and tram\",\"2 買い物なら: 銅鑼湾・旺角 with SOGO and neon street\",\"3 家族旅行なら: ディズニーランド・オーシャンパーク with castle, panda, coaster\",\"旅のヒント: practical icons for Octopus card, Wi‑Fi, weather, distance and travel tips\"]},\"bottom legend\":{\"position\":\"bottom edge\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"Star Ferry solid blue line\",\"Airport Express blue dashed line\",\"MTR red dotted line\",\"bus/tram small gray icons\"]},\"decorative details\":\"clouds at the top, yellow accent rays near headings, miniature skyline photos inside rounded rectangles, small red sailing junk boat at bottom right, soft drop shadows, cheerful tourist-brochure atmosphere\",\"accuracy instruction\":\"Create an attractive simplified tourism infographic rather than a geographically precise map; keep the labels in Japanese and make every major label readable.\",\"color palette\":\"{argument name=\\\"color palette\\\" default=\\\"sky blue ocean, sandy yellow land, leafy green parks, red and navy headline, pink and blue attraction cards\\\"}\",\"poster mood\":\"{argument name=\\\"poster mood\\\" default=\\\"welcoming first-time visitor guide\\\"}\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18141.jpg"]},{"i":10132,"text":"Create a high-resolution square abstract sci-fi visualization of {argument name=\"concept\" default=\"artificial general intelligence emerging from multimodal image generation\"}: a dark navy-black digital void filled with faint radial circuit traces and tiny blue data particles, converging toward the center. In the middle, render a translucent, organic, brain-like cloud or neural membrane made of pale electric-blue volumetric mist, with soft glassy folds and semi-transparent edges. At its core, place a brilliant {argument name=\"core light color\" default=\"golden-yellow\"} starburst of sparkling particles, suggesting intelligence igniting inside a neural network. Four broad, ghostly streams of data extend outward from the center toward the top, bottom, left, and right, like flowing arms made of wireframe dots, glowing blue filaments, and faint circuitry. Add curved neon-blue signal lines spiraling and weaving through the streams, with depth-of-field blur and subtle motion streaks radiating into the background. Use a cinematic futuristic style, volumetric lighting, high contrast, ethereal glow, deep shadows, intricate particle detail, no text, no people, no logos, centered symmetrical composition, dramatic sense of emergence and technological transcendence.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18142.jpg"]},{"i":10133,"text":"{\"type\":\"wide editorial brochure cover for a Tokyo art gallery guide\",\"format\":\"16:9 landscape flyer, clean print-ready design, off-white paper background, crisp vector typography mixed with photographic art thumbnails\",\"style\":\"modern Japanese magazine layout, bold condensed sans-serif headline, blue and coral accent colors, thin black dividers, rounded information cards, generous margins\",\"parameters\":{\"main headline\":\"{argument name=\\\"main headline\\\" default=\\\"TOKYO GALLERY GUIDE\\\"}\",\"date range\":\"{argument name=\\\"date range\\\" default=\\\"5/2–5/6\\\"}\",\"featured gallery\":\"{argument name=\\\"featured gallery\\\" default=\\\"104GALERIE\\\"}\",\"featured artist\":\"{argument name=\\\"featured artist\\\" default=\\\"Aneta Kaizer\\\"}\",\"featured exhibition\":\"{argument name=\\\"featured exhibition\\\" default=\\\"Traumlandschaften\\\"}\"},\"layout\":{\"top_header\":{\"position\":\"top third\",\"elements_count\":5,\"elements\":[\"huge black title text: TOKYO GALLERY GUIDE\",\"blue subheading: GUIDE GALLERY\",\"black date text: 5/2–5/6\",\"Japanese label: 展覧会ガイド\",\"page indicator at top right: 1 / 10 with a short underline\"],\"illustration\":\"thin blue line-art Tokyo skyline on the right including Rainbow Bridge, Tokyo Skytree, modern towers, and a temple-like roof, with a large flat coral-red sun behind the skyline\"},\"main_image_strip\":{\"position\":\"middle\",\"count\":5,\"description\":\"five slanted rectangular exhibition preview images separated by white diagonal gutters\",\"items\":[\"abstract impasto painting with cream, navy, orange, and beige blocks\",\"black-and-white rainy street photograph with a silhouetted person holding an umbrella\",\"dim contemporary installation room with vertical hanging light strands and small dark sculptural objects on the floor\",\"collage-style graphic poster with torn paper textures, orange circle, black record shape, blue stripes, and vintage typography\",\"black donut-shaped abstract sculpture on a white pedestal against a gray studio background\"]},\"bottom_cards\":{\"position\":\"bottom third\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[{\"type\":\"large featured exhibition card\",\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"contents_count\":5,\"contents\":[\"vertical coral accent bar\",\"gallery name in coral: 104GALERIE\",\"artist name in large black type: Aneta Kaizer\",\"exhibition title: Traumlandschaften\",\"dates: 4.17–5.23\"]},{\"type\":\"stat card\",\"position\":\"bottom center-left\",\"contents_count\":3,\"contents\":[\"blue line icon of a framed artwork on a museum rope stand\",\"large blue text: 40+\",\"small black label: EXHIBITIONS\"]},{\"type\":\"location card\",\"position\":\"bottom center-right\",\"contents_count\":3,\"contents\":[\"blue Tokyo Tower line icon\",\"large blue text: TOKYO\",\"Japanese subtitle: 東京のギャラリーを巡る\"]},{\"type\":\"recommendation card\",\"position\":\"bottom right\",\"contents_count\":3,\"contents\":[\"coral outlined star icon\",\"large coral text: GW\",\"black text: PICKS\"]}]},\"footer_note\":{\"position\":\"bottom right edge\",\"text\":\"※会期・開廊日は各会場で再確認\"}},\"composition_notes\":\"Use precise alignment and high contrast. The header spans nearly the full width, the image strip occupies a long horizontal band, and the four rounded cards sit evenly along the bottom with subtle shadows. Keep the overall look like a curated gallery event pamphlet cover, professional and information-rich.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18143.jpg"]},{"i":10134,"text":"Create a deliberately rough, hand-drawn digital doodle on a plain white background, like quick Microsoft Paint line art with uneven black outlines, flat colors, scribbled shading, and a playful amateur anime style. Show a single flying fantasy battle maid knight, a young anime woman with {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"bright blonde\"} hair streaming wildly backward, large blue eyes, a small open surprised smile, and a white frilly maid headband with tiny dark flower details. She is posed diagonally as if lunging through the air from upper left to lower right, holding one thin rapier in her forward hand, with the blade extending far to the left and a simple circular hand guard. Her outfit combines maid clothing and armor: shiny silver shoulder pauldrons and chest armor over a white bodice, brown belts and a gold buckle at the neck, a short white frilled skirt with circular spiral decorations, white thigh-high stockings with lace trim, and white armored shoes with small gold accents. Add a dramatic {argument name=\"scarf color\" default=\"turquoise blue\"} scarf or cape whipping behind her to the right, painted with energetic scribble strokes and darker blue at the far end. Use minimal detail but clear recognizable shapes, visible construction-like sketch lines, messy yellow hair strokes, gray armor strokes, and a whimsical action-fantasy feeling, with no text and no background scenery.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18144.jpg"]},{"i":10135,"text":"{\"type\":\"wide Japanese promotional web banner / social ad\",\"canvas\":{\"aspect_ratio\":\"very wide 3:1\",\"size\":\"1200x480\",\"background\":\"deep navy to near-black solid gradient\",\"border\":\"thin bright green line along the very top and very bottom edges\",\"style\":\"clean flat vector UI, corporate delivery-service ad, high contrast typography\"},\"brand\":{\"position\":\"top-left\",\"logo\":\"small rounded green square icon with a white downward triangle, next to bold white lowercase wordmark\",\"text_lines\":[\"menu\",\"配達クルー\"]},\"layout\":{\"sections_count\":5,\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"brand block\",\"position\":\"upper left\",\"elements_count\":2,\"elements\":[\"green app icon\",\"white menu / 配達クルー logo text\"]},{\"title\":\"reward amount block\",\"position\":\"left middle\",\"elements_count\":3,\"elements\":[\"small yellow text 最大\",\"large yellow amount 15,000\",\"yellow yen symbol 円 below, with a small green-and-white check/leaf accent overlapping the final zeros\"]},{\"title\":\"main campaign message\",\"position\":\"upper center\",\"elements_count\":3,\"elements\":[\"large white headline 友達招待キャンペーン\",\"smaller white subheadline 今なら紹介する人もされる人も\",\"green emphasis line それぞれ15,000円ゲット！\"]},{\"title\":\"invite code card\",\"position\":\"center lower\",\"elements_count\":2,\"elements\":[\"large red rounded rectangle\",\"white label 招待コード and bold code RKE247\"]},{\"title\":\"eligibility/date block\",\"position\":\"upper right\",\"elements_count\":3,\"elements\":[\"green rounded pill 東京・神奈川限定\",\"small white text 20回配達でボーナス\",\"white date range 2026/4/27 ～ 5/31\"]}],\"decorations_count\":3,\"decorations\":[\"small gray X close icon in the extreme top-right corner\",\"thin dark outlined irregular pentagon on the right side\",\"small flat green delivery truck icon with dark wheels near the lower-right\"]},\"typography\":{\"headline\":\"bold Japanese sans-serif, white\",\"numbers\":\"extra-large bold sans-serif, yellow\",\"body\":\"clean sans-serif, white and green accents\"},\"color_palette\":{\"navy\":\"#070d1d\",\"green\":\"#00a86b\",\"yellow\":\"#ffc928\",\"red\":\"#e72727\",\"white\":\"#ffffff\",\"gray\":\"#2b3140\"},\"text_content\":{\"headline\":\"{argument name=\\\"headline text\\\" default=\\\"友達招待キャンペーン\\\"}\",\"subheadline\":\"{argument name=\\\"subheadline text\\\" default=\\\"今なら紹介する人もされる人も\\\"}\",\"reward_text\":\"{argument name=\\\"reward amount\\\" default=\\\"15,000円\\\"}\",\"invite_code\":\"{argument name=\\\"invite code\\\" default=\\\"RKE247\\\"}\",\"region_offer\":\"{argument name=\\\"region offer text\\\" default=\\\"東京・神奈川限定 20回配達でボーナス\\\"}\"},\"composition_notes\":\"Keep the banner airy with most elements aligned to the upper half, strong negative space in the bottom center, crisp vector shapes, no people, no photo realism, and preserve the exact Japanese text placement and color hierarchy.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18148.jpg"]},{"i":10136,"text":"Create a realistic vertical portrait photograph of a {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"young adult woman\"} standing indoors in an ornate vintage European room, viewed from behind and slightly in profile as she looks toward a bright window on the right. She has very long, flowing {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"pale blonde\"} wavy hair cascading down her back to her waist, softly backlit with delicate highlights. She wears a {argument name=\"dress color\" default=\"deep navy blue\"} sleeveless classic Lolita-style dress with thin shoulder straps, a fitted bodice, a full knee-length gathered skirt, a ruffled hem, and white lace ruffle trim across the chest, with a dark ribbon or lace choker at the neck. Her visible face is completely covered by a flat rectangular beige skin-tone censor/glitch block centered over the head, with sharp straight edges and no facial features visible. The room contains sheer cream lace curtains glowing in daylight, a tall white-framed window, an ornate carved wooden dresser on the left, a vase of white flowers, a dark framed antique painting or mirror behind it, and a beige brocade upholstered armchair on the right. Use soft natural window light, shallow depth of field, warm muted colors, elegant romantic atmosphere, realistic fabric texture, detailed hair strands, 3:4 composition, high-resolution fashion editorial style.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18149.jpg"]},{"i":10137,"text":"{\"type\":\"wide Japanese promotional web banner advertisement\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"2.4:1 landscape\",\"style\":\"clean high-contrast commercial graphic design, bold red black white palette, glossy gradients, drop shadows, thick outlined typography, energetic delivery-service campaign look\",\"brand\":{\"position\":\"top left\",\"logo\":\"red and green geometric menu logo followed by black 'menu' wordmark\",\"headline\":\"{argument name=\\\"service title\\\" default=\\\"配達クルー\\\"}\"},\"main_offer\":{\"position\":\"left and center\",\"count\":4,\"elements\":[\"yellow circular checkmark icon at far left\",\"vertical black text '最大'\",\"huge red number '15,000' with white outline and shadow\",\"small red '円' and bold black 'ボーナス' below\"],\"primary_amount\":\"{argument name=\\\"bonus amount\\\" default=\\\"15,000円\\\"}\",\"supporting_ribbon\":{\"position\":\"lower left-center\",\"text\":\"東京・神奈川のエリア限定で 1.5万円ボーナス\",\"colors\":\"black label block connected to red arrow ribbon with yellow amount text\"}},\"top_badges\":{\"position\":\"top center\",\"count\":2,\"labels\":[\"友達紹介キャンペーン\",\"東京・神奈川限定\"],\"appearance\":[\"red rounded rectangle with white text\",\"black rounded rectangle with white location-pin icon and white text\"]},\"background\":{\"base\":\"white with faint diagonal speed lines\",\"map\":\"pale pink silhouette map behind the main number and card\",\"decorations_count\":4,\"decorations\":[\"red map pin near lower center\",\"yellow burst marks around the bonus text\",\"red angular speed stripe in upper right\",\"subtle gray/red line accents\"]},\"invitation_card\":{\"position\":\"right side\",\"appearance\":\"large white rounded rectangle card with red header and red border, slight shadow\",\"header\":\"招待コード\",\"code\":\"{argument name=\\\"invitation code\\\" default=\\\"RKE247\\\"}\",\"code_style\":\"very large bold black uppercase characters\",\"message\":\"このコードを使って登録するだけで特典 GET!\",\"icon\":\"red outline gift icon inside a circle\"},\"phone_mockup\":{\"position\":\"upper right overlapping card\",\"screen\":\"map route with red pin and red delivery scooter icon\",\"appearance\":\"tilted smartphone with black bezel and shadow\"},\"call_to_action\":{\"position\":\"bottom right overlapping invitation card\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"call to action text\\\" default=\\\"キャンペーンを見る\\\"}\",\"appearance\":\"large glossy red-orange pill button with white bold text, white border, drop shadow, circular white arrow icon on the right\"},\"date_bar\":{\"position\":\"bottom left full width under offer\",\"count\":3,\"elements\":[\"red clock icon\",\"red label '期間限定'\",\"date range '{argument name=\\\"campaign dates\\\" default=\\\"2026年4月27日(月) ～ 2026年5月31日(日)\\\"}' in black inside a white outlined rectangle\"]},\"composition\":\"place the main bonus amount as the dominant focal point on the left, the invitation-code card and CTA as the dominant action area on the right, keep all Japanese text crisp and readable, use strong shadows and red accents for urgency\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18150.jpg"]},{"i":10138,"text":"Using the provided reference image, regenerate the same composition as a soft modern watercolor illustration. Preserve the subject’s pose, outfit, proportions, cropped face anonymization, and office-window setting, but reinterpret everything with translucent washes, loose edges, granulating paper texture, muted warm beige lighting, gentle color bleeding, and lightly suggested background details instead of photorealism. Keep the image square and maintain the same overall framing.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18152.jpg"]},{"i":10139,"text":"Using the provided reference image, transform it into an ornate Japanese Rinpa-school decorative painting style while preserving the woman’s pose, proportions, outfit silhouette, anonymized face block, and overall framing. Replace the modern office/window background with a lavish gold-leaf folding-screen composition. Add 5 main decorative motif groups: 1) textured gold and silver leaf cloud shapes, 2) flowing deep-blue stylized water with gold wave lines, 3) purple irises with long green leaves on the left and lower foreground, 4) pale cherry blossoms on branches in the upper right, and 5) layered white, gold, and muted floral clusters around the lower and right edges. Integrate the same Rinpa motifs onto the navy dress and white blouse as if painted or gilded on the fabric, especially gold floral sprays and wave patterns, while keeping the subject photorealistic enough to match the reference. Use rich metallic texture, elegant Japanese screen-painting ornamentation, dense decorative layering, and a harmonious gold, navy, ivory, green, and violet palette.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18153.jpg"]},{"i":10140,"text":"Using the provided reference image as the base, regenerate it as a photorealistic candid convenience-store checkout moment. Keep the same employee, uniform, counter setting, and blurred/anonymized face treatment, but change the action so the employee is facing forward and extending both hands to pass a bottled drink to {argument name=\"customer type\" default=\"a female customer\"}. Add the customer only as an out-of-focus foreground figure on the right, seen from behind/side, partially blocking the frame. Make the composition feel like an unposed smartphone snapshot: imperfect framing, slight handheld motion blur, natural skin tones, camera noise, shallow depth of field, and realistic fluorescent convenience-store lighting. Keep the Korean convenience-store signage and cigarette display atmosphere in the background, with the POS screen and barcode scanner visible near the counter.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18155.jpg"]},{"i":10141,"text":"Create a single-panel naive crayon-style cartoon illustration of {argument name=\"character description\" default=\"a surprised young woman with a round peach face, black bob haircut, dot eyes, and a wide open pink mouth\"} standing in a small creative studio. She wears {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"a pink cardigan over a black shirt, a red skirt, and red shoes\"} and stands beside a large gray desktop computer monitor and gray keyboard on the left. The background is a vivid {argument name=\"wall color\" default=\"hot pink\"} wall covered with exactly 7 abstract framed wall pieces: a yellow geometric poster at top left, a small red vertical poster near the upper left center, a blue geometric poster at top center, an orange geometric poster at top right center, a tall blue poster on the far right with a white face-like abstract shape, a small white vertical mini picture near the right of the character, and a red-and-white geometric picture at mid-right. Include a blue cup holding exactly 3 pencils at the lower left, a yellow chair behind the character, and a teal trash bin at the lower right containing crumpled paper and a red object. Use thick uneven black outlines, visible wax-crayon scribble texture, childlike proportions, flat bright colors, rough hand-drawn shapes, no realistic shading, playful manga-comic energy, and a slightly chaotic artist workspace composition.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18156.jpg"]},{"i":10142,"text":"{\"type\":\"bright Japanese social-media infographic poster\",\"format\":\"single square poster, 4:5-ish dense layout, white and pale blue background with blue panel borders, pink accents, yellow sparkles, speech bubbles, arrows, rounded cards, sticker-like anime characters and mascot animals\",\"language\":\"Japanese visible text\",\"headline\":{\"position\":\"top center\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"headline text\\\" default=\\\"こうやって作ったよ！ ChatGPTと会話しながら 画像→動画を作る流れ\\\"}\",\"style\":\"large bold Japanese lettering, dark navy and purple for ChatGPT, hot pink for 画像→動画, celebratory marks\"},\"top_characters\":{\"count\":4,\"descriptions\":[\"left: tall black-haired anime man in dark jacket, face intentionally blurred\",\"left-center: blond anime young man in blue embroidered jacket pointing upward, face intentionally blurred\",\"right: smiling panda mascot wearing blue work overalls\",\"right-lower: red panda mascot in blue hoodie next to a red-haired woman in sunglasses\"]},\"intro_line\":{\"text\":\"キャラ画像を見せて相談 → 方向性を決める → 画像を作る → 修正する → 動画構成を考える → プロンプト化 → 完成!\",\"style\":\"small bold text under headline with pink arrow separators\"},\"layout\":{\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"制作フロー\",\"position\":\"upper middle\",\"count\":6,\"style\":\"six numbered blue-bordered cards connected by dark blue arrows\",\"cards\":[{\"number\":\"1\",\"title\":\"1. キャラを見せて相談\",\"visual\":\"small group thumbnail of four characters and panda, plus lower anime man portrait\",\"body\":\"『このキャラ達で記念画像を作りたい』と伝える\"},{\"number\":\"2\",\"title\":\"2.方向性を整理\",\"visual\":\"clipboard checklist and color palette, blond character making peace sign\",\"body\":\"構図・雰囲気・色の案を出してもらう\"},{\"number\":\"3\",\"title\":\"3.画像を生成\",\"visual\":\"night city fireworks image thumbnail, black-haired man giving thumbs up\",\"body\":\"気になる案を選んで1枚絵を作る\"},{\"number\":\"4\",\"title\":\"4.会話しながら修正\",\"visual\":\"two overlapping chat bubbles, blond character making OK sign\",\"body\":\"『前に出す』『色を華やかに』『ここだけ変える』が言いやすい\"},{\"number\":\"5\",\"title\":\"5. 動画構成に発展\",\"visual\":\"film frame with play button, red-haired spiky anime man\",\"body\":\"完成画像をもとに動き・演出・オチまで設計できる\"},{\"number\":\"6\",\"title\":\"6. 動画用プロンプト化\",\"visual\":\"paper labeled PROMPT, dark-haired woman pointing\",\"body\":\"Seedance 2.0用などに整理して完成!\"}]},{\"title\":\"ChatGPTと作るメリット\",\"position\":\"middle\",\"count\":6,\"style\":\"six pink-numbered benefit cards in two rows, white cards with pink borders and icons\",\"cards\":[{\"number\":\"1\",\"title\":\"初心者でも進めやすい\",\"icon\":\"beginner mark with check\",\"body\":\"何を決めればいいか順番に整理できる\",\"character\":\"white-haired anime man face blurred\"},{\"number\":\"2\",\"title\":\"相談しながら作れる\",\"icon\":\"pink chat arrows\",\"body\":\"思いつきをそのまま言葉で投げられる\",\"character\":\"red-haired woman with sunglasses\"},{\"number\":\"3\",\"title\":\"修正指示がしやすい\",\"icon\":\"blue pencil edit icon\",\"body\":\"『ここだけ直したい』が伝えやすい\",\"character\":\"blond character face blurred\"},{\"number\":\"4\",\"title\":\"アイデアが広がる\",\"icon\":\"yellow lightbulb\",\"body\":\"構図・演出・色の案を比較しやすい\",\"character\":\"dark-haired woman face blurred\"},{\"number\":\"5\",\"title\":\"画像から動画へつなげやすい\",\"icon\":\"movie clapper/play icon\",\"body\":\"静止画を起点に構成や動きを考えられる\",\"character\":\"black spiky armored creature giving thumbs up\"},{\"number\":\"6\",\"title\":\"プロンプト作成まで一貫\",\"icon\":\"clipboard checklist\",\"body\":\"最後は各ツール用に整えて使える\",\"character\":\"blond character pointing\"}]},{\"title\":\"こんな人におすすめ\",\"position\":\"lower middle\",\"count\":3,\"style\":\"three recommendation cards with blue borders and icons\",\"cards\":[{\"title\":\"AI制作を始めたばかり\",\"icon\":\"beginner mark\",\"character\":\"red panda mascot\"},{\"title\":\"画像から動画まで作りたい\",\"icon\":\"movie camera\",\"character\":\"panda mascot\"},{\"title\":\"試行錯誤をもっとラクにしたい\",\"icon\":\"pink rising arrow\",\"character\":\"black-haired glasses anime man\"}]}]},\"footer\":{\"position\":\"bottom\",\"background\":\"deep navy starry gradient banner\",\"main_quote\":\"{argument name=\\\"footer quote\\\" default=\\\"“思いつき”を会話で形にしやすい！\\\"}\",\"subtext\":\"ChatGPTは、アイデア整理・画像制作・修正・動画設計・プロンプト化まで つなげやすい\",\"visuals\":\"large red panda mascot on left pointing upward with red glove, neon blue and pink chat bubble icons on right, yellow sparkles\"},\"style\":{\"illustration\":\"polished anime and mascot collage, YouTube thumbnail energy, crisp vector-infographic UI, glossy icons, expressive characters, intentional blurred rectangular face areas on several human characters\",\"colors\":\"white, sky blue, deep navy, hot pink, purple, yellow sparkle accents\",\"typography\":\"bold rounded Japanese display fonts, high contrast, dense but readable, numbered circles\"},\"customization\":{\"main tool\":\"{argument name=\\\"main tool name\\\" default=\\\"ChatGPT\\\"}\",\"video tool\":\"{argument name=\\\"video tool name\\\" default=\\\"Seedance 2.0\\\"}\",\"background tone\":\"{argument name=\\\"background tone\\\" default=\\\"bright blue and pink celebratory tech infographic\\\"}\"}}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18158.jpg"]},{"i":10143,"text":"Create a dynamic cinematic digital illustration of a {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"mountain biker\"} racing downhill through a tunnel-like canyon of dense abstract flower petals and rounded foliage shapes. Use an extreme low-angle wide shot from directly in front of the bike, with the oversized front tire dominating the lower center foreground and the rider leaning aggressively forward over the handlebars. The rider wears a sleek full-face helmet with a black reflective visor, a fitted futuristic cycling suit in {argument name=\"rider colors\" default=\"hot pink, coral, and deep navy\"}, gloves, and protective gear. Surround the scene with thick walls of stylized petals and leaf silhouettes in {argument name=\"environment colors\" default=\"vivid pink, red, coral, orange, and white\"}, forming a rushing corridor that suggests speed and motion. Add large blurred foreground petal shapes on the left and right edges for depth, dark navy shadow shapes for contrast, and a warm peach-orange glowing background at the vanishing point. The style should be highly aesthetic, bold, graphic, semi-abstract, with smooth vector-like shapes, painterly gradients, dramatic foreshortening, high saturation, strong rim lighting, motion energy, and no visible text.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18159.jpg"]},{"i":10144,"text":"Create a cinematic, high-aesthetic street photograph of {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"a young woman with a short dark bob haircut\"} walking through a crowded urban crosswalk or busy city street in Japan. She is shown from the side in a close medium shot, slightly off-center to the right, wearing {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"a loose white shirt layered over a dark plaid dress or pinafore\"}, with a thin shoulder strap visible and small earrings catching the light. Her face is intentionally obscured by a soft rectangular privacy block, while her hair and clothing remain sharply lit. The background contains a bustling crowd of pedestrians, tall city buildings, signage, and traffic shapes, all rendered as heavy bokeh and motion blur. Use a dynamic Dutch angle, shallow depth of field, 35mm film photography look, vibrant teal-blue shadows and warm orange highlights, strong backlight from the late afternoon sun, high contrast, lens bloom, slight chromatic aberration, candid snapshot energy, fashion street-style mood, ultra aesthetic composition, natural imperfections, no readable text.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18160.jpg"]},{"i":10145,"text":"Create a wide cinematic telephoto landscape photograph of {argument name=\"city name\" default=\"Tokyo\"} at blue hour, viewed from a high observation deck, with a vast dense urban skyline filling the lower half of the frame in cool monochromatic cobalt-blue tones. In the far distance, center the dark silhouette of {argument name=\"mountain name\" default=\"Mount Fuji\"} rising above a long jagged mountain range on the horizon. Add a thin vivid magenta-pink twilight glow tracing the horizon behind the mountains, fading upward into a clear deep cyan-blue sky that occupies the upper half of the image. Use atmospheric haze to soften distant buildings and mountains, tiny scattered city lights, crisp but slightly dreamy high-end travel photography aesthetics, serene mood, minimal composition, no people, no text, 16:9 aspect ratio.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18161.jpg"]},{"i":10146,"text":"Using the provided reference photo as the character base, transform it into a high-energy, full-body shoujo manga / pop-idol illustration. Preserve the rainbow hair as the defining feature and keep the square face-obscuring block in place. Change the pose to a dynamic jumping idol pose: one arm raised making a peace sign, the other hand clenched near the chest, and one leg lifted. Replace the bar setting and white shirt with a colorful stage-idol outfit: a pink varsity-style jacket, bow-trimmed crop top, pleated pink/yellow/purple skirt, belt and chain accessories, bracelets, large polka-dot hair bow, fishnet thigh-high, striped leg warmers, and chunky sneakers. Add a saturated comic-pop background with halftone dots, lightning-burst shapes, hearts, and stars. Include exactly 2 large comic sound-effect captions: {argument name=\"top left caption\" default=\"YEAH!\"} and {argument name=\"bottom right caption\" default=\"POP!\"}. Use bold outlines, glossy highlights, neon pink/yellow/blue colors, exaggerated cute proportions, and a polished Japanese少女漫画 illustration finish.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18162.jpg"]},{"i":10147,"text":"Using the provided reference image as the character base, transform it into a high-energy tall-proportioned shoujo/anime idol illustration. Preserve the rainbow hair as the key identity feature, but redraw the subject in a dynamic pop-star pose: one hand making a peace sign toward the viewer and the other clenched in a cute energetic fist. Replace the real bar setting and plain shirt with a vivid Harajuku idol outfit: pink-and-purple patterned crop top, cropped jacket, frilly mini skirt, wide belt with dangling chains and star charms, striped knee sock, pink sneaker, layered bead bracelets, heart and star jewelry, and a large pink polka-dot bow. Add a saturated comic-pop background filled with halftone dots, hearts, stars, sparkles, paint splashes, and speech-bubble typography. Include exactly 3 comic text bubbles: “YEAH!” in the upper left, “LOVE IT!” on the right, and “POP!” in the lower left. Keep the face area obscured with a plain square censor block like the reference. Use bright glossy colors, thick clean linework, dramatic manga highlights, and a cheerful magazine-cover composition.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18163.jpg"]},{"i":10148,"text":"{\"type\":\"gritty retro Japanese sci-fi war movie poster\",\"style\":\"hyper-detailed cinematic key art, 1980s mecha anime realism, distressed printed-paper texture, smoky watercolor edges, dramatic firelight, ash, sparks, high contrast, weathered typography, vertical poster composition\",\"format\":\"portrait poster, off-white aged background with full-bleed battle collage\",\"main_title\":\"{argument name=\\\"main title\\\" default=\\\"CHIRICO CUVIE\\\"}\",\"subtitle\":\"キリコ・キュービィ\",\"setting\":\"post-apocalyptic industrial battlefield with burning refinery towers, skeletal metal structures, black smoke clouds, explosions, falling ash, rubble and wet scorched ground\",\"layout\":{\"logo\":{\"position\":\"top left\",\"description\":\"red angular military/mecha emblem resembling a sharp V-shaped insignia\"},\"text_blocks\":{\"count\":6,\"items\":[{\"position\":\"upper left vertical\",\"text\":\"戦場を生き抜け。\\nそれが、俺のすべてだ。\",\"style\":\"black Japanese vertical slogan with a thin red vertical rule and black divider line\"},{\"position\":\"lower left\",\"text\":\"CHIRICO CUVIE\",\"style\":\"huge distressed block sans-serif title, CHIRICO in dark red, CUVIE in black\"},{\"position\":\"below title\",\"text\":\"キリコ・キュービィ\",\"style\":\"small black Japanese katakana name with red diagonal stripe marks underneath\"},{\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"text\":\"ARMORED TROOPER\\nVOTOMS\",\"style\":\"small franchise-style label, black and red, with diagonal red stripe marks\"},{\"position\":\"lower right\",\"text\":\"SURVIVE\\nTHE\\nBATTLEFIELD\",\"style\":\"stacked English slogan, SURVIVE in red, rest in black, framed by thin vertical lines\"},{\"position\":\"bottom right boxed label\",\"text\":\"PLANET\\nGUILTY\\nYEAR\\nU.C. 0197\",\"style\":\"tiny red outlined technical data box\"}]},\"characters\":{\"count\":5,\"items\":[{\"description\":\"enormous background bust of a stern young male soldier, cropped at forehead and chest, wearing a red pilot suit and dark armored shoulder plate, face covered by a large flat opaque brown censor rectangle\",\"position\":\"upper center to right\",\"scale\":\"dominant background figure\"},{\"description\":\"large portrait of a young woman with long windblown brown hair and a pale pink futuristic jacket, face covered by a smaller opaque brown censor rectangle\",\"position\":\"middle left\",\"scale\":\"secondary portrait\"},{\"description\":\"full-body male pilot standing in the foreground, wearing a fitted {argument name=\\\"pilot suit color\\\" default=\\\"deep red\\\"} armored flight suit with black boots, belts, gloves, knee pads and chest harness, face blurred/obscured, confident neutral stance with one hand relaxed\",\"position\":\"front center\",\"scale\":\"primary full-body hero\"},{\"description\":\"small inset scene of the same male pilot embracing or standing close to the young woman, both faces covered by opaque censor blocks\",\"position\":\"lower left above title\",\"scale\":\"small emotional vignette\"},{\"description\":\"large olive-green armored combat mecha with rounded helmet-like head, red and green camera lenses, antennas, bulky plated shoulders, tank-like torso, mechanical arms, and a large forearm cannon aimed downward\",\"position\":\"right side\",\"scale\":\"coequal with foreground hero\"}]},\"vehicles\":{\"count\":1,\"items\":[{\"description\":\"small military helicopter silhouette flying through smoke\",\"position\":\"upper right\"}]},\"background_structures\":{\"count\":5,\"items\":[\"large burning refinery tower behind the mecha on the upper right\",\"smoky industrial fortress with crane on the upper left\",\"small burning tower cluster at lower left\",\"central burning tower behind the foreground hero near the bottom\",\"distant industrial ruins along the bottom horizon\"]},\"color_palette\":\"charcoal black smoke, rust red suit and title, olive drab armor, orange fire, dirty cream paper, muted steel gray\",\"camera_and_lighting\":\"epic low-angle poster lighting, strong rim light from explosions, smoky atmospheric depth, sharp detailed armor, painterly photorealistic faces and fabric except deliberately obscured face areas\",\"customization_notes\":\"Keep all visible poster text exactly as specified, maintain the six text blocks, five character elements, one helicopter, and five industrial structure groups.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18164.jpg"]},{"i":10149,"text":"Create a vertical semi-realistic digital illustration of {argument name=\"character type\" default=\"an elegant adult East Asian fantasy noblewoman\"} seated indoors in a dim, luxurious ancient Chinese-inspired study or palace room. She wears a deep {argument name=\"main robe color\" default=\"burgundy red\"} low-cut silk dress with ornate gold embroidery, layered under a sheer glossy black outer robe with flowing translucent sleeves and black sash, giving a refined wuxia/xianxia courtesan or noble consort aesthetic. Her long {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"black\"} hair is styled half-up with elaborate gold hairpins, delicate chains, small red tassels, and long dangling earrings. Compose her from mid-thigh to head in a relaxed seated pose, one arm resting on a wooden armrest and the other hand draped gracefully over her lap, with soft skin highlights, detailed fabric folds, and polished hands. The face should be completely obscured by a centered opaque {argument name=\"face cover color\" default=\"muted brown\"} square censor block, while the hair, ears, neck, collarbones, and clothing remain visible. Use warm cinematic lantern lighting, shallow depth of field, dark wooden furniture, blurred shelves and glowing lamps in the background, rich shadows, high-detail painterly realism, glossy silk texture, gold accents, sensual but elegant mood, portrait orientation, 2:3 aspect ratio.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18165.jpg"]},{"i":10150,"text":"{\"type\":\"cute vertical mobile puzzle game screen mockup\",\"style\":\"soft Studio Ghibli-inspired kawaii 3D clay-toy illustration, rounded UI, pastel colors, gentle shadows, clean app screenshot composition\",\"canvas\":{\"aspect\":\"landscape frame containing a centered portrait phone game panel\",\"background\":\"pale mint green with large translucent circular shapes and a soft darker green floor band near the bottom\"},\"ui\":{\"outer_panel\":\"tall rounded rectangle card in very light mint with subtle drop shadow, centered\",\"header\":{\"position\":\"top of card\",\"components_count\":4,\"components\":[{\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"game title\\\" default=\\\"コロコロトトロ\\\"}\",\"position\":\"top left\",\"style\":\"bold dark green Japanese sans serif\"},{\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"score text\\\" default=\\\"スコア 7425\\\"}\",\"position\":\"under title\",\"style\":\"smaller dark green\"},{\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"instruction text\\\" default=\\\"クリックで落とす\\\"}\",\"position\":\"under score\",\"style\":\"small dark green\"},{\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"next label\\\" default=\\\"つぎ\\\"}\",\"position\":\"top right\",\"style\":\"small dark green with an acorn preview beneath it\"}]},\"playfield\":{\"position\":\"center\",\"shape\":\"tall cream-colored rounded rectangle bordered by a thick muted forest-green outline\",\"warning_line\":{\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"game over warning\\\" default=\\\"ここを越えて詰まるとゲームオーバー\\\"}\",\"position\":\"near top inside playfield\",\"style\":\"thin red horizontal line with small red Japanese text above it\"}}},\"game_pieces\":{\"total_visible_count\":25,\"counts_by_type\":[{\"type\":\"gray Totoro pieces\",\"count\":2,\"descriptions\":[\"large gray Totoro floating near upper center\",\"large gray Totoro resting mid-left\"]},{\"type\":\"blue Totoro pieces\",\"count\":2,\"descriptions\":[\"small blue Totoro near center\",\"small blue Totoro near lower left\"]},{\"type\":\"white small Totoro ghost pieces\",\"count\":4,\"descriptions\":[\"upright white Totoro at left middle\",\"upright white Totoro at right middle\",\"sideways white Totoro at right center\",\"tiny white Totoro near upper left under the warning line\"]},{\"type\":\"Catbus piece\",\"count\":1,\"descriptions\":[\"large smiling orange Catbus crouched at lower right\"]},{\"type\":\"black soot sprite pieces\",\"count\":5,\"descriptions\":[\"black soot sprite at left middle edge\",\"black soot sprite near center-left\",\"black soot sprite at right middle\",\"black soot sprite near bottom center\",\"black soot sprite at bottom right\"]},{\"type\":\"corn cob pieces\",\"count\":5,\"descriptions\":[\"corn cob at upper right\",\"corn cob at right of center\",\"corn cob near center-left above Catbus\",\"corn cob at bottom left\",\"corn cob near mid-right beside blue Totoro\"]},{\"type\":\"acorn pieces\",\"count\":6,\"descriptions\":[\"large acorn preview above playfield near next label\",\"small acorn at upper left inside playfield\",\"small acorn at left middle\",\"small acorn at center-right\",\"small acorn at lower left edge\",\"small acorn at lower right beside Catbus\"]}]},\"composition\":\"The pieces are arranged like a Suika-style falling merge puzzle: round character tokens pile up in the lower two-thirds of the playfield, with open empty space at the top and a red game-over threshold line. Make everything soft, collectible, toy-like, cheerful, and polished, with no realistic harsh edges.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18166.jpg"]},{"i":10151,"text":"{\"type\":\"information-dense Japanese mecha design sheet for a fantasy sci-fi anime\",\"language\":\"Japanese technical labels and headings, with clean printed typography\",\"format\":\"wide 16:9 concept art reference board on a white and light gray background, thin gray panel borders, magazine-style layout\",\"title_block\":{\"position\":\"upper left\",\"emblem\":\"dark imperial crest icon\",\"main_text\":\"汎用量産型機動兵器 MSJ-97X ヴェルディガー\",\"series_text\":\"帝国軍・正規量産シリーズ\",\"subject_name\":\"{argument name=\\\"mecha model name\\\" default=\\\"MSJ-97X ヴェルディガー\\\"}\",\"description_columns\":\"short Japanese lore paragraph and spec boxes\"},\"main_subject\":{\"description\":\"a heavily armored humanoid mass-production mobile weapon, tall heroic proportions, dark gunmetal inner frame, layered silver-gray and black armor plates with gold trim, small blue sensors, angular knight-like helmet, broad shoulders, heavy legs, mechanical hands, backpack equipment, glowing circular halo ring above the head, fantasy-SF aura\",\"pose\":\"front-left three-quarter standing pose holding a long rifle in one hand and a long purple energy blade or sword at the side\",\"armor_color\":\"{argument name=\\\"armor color scheme\\\" default=\\\"silver gray, gunmetal black, gold accents, blue sensors, purple energy glow\\\"}\",\"rendering_style\":\"high-detail anime mechanical concept art, crisp linework, realistic hard-surface shading, subtle watercolor-gray shadows, premium production design sheet\"},\"centerpiece\":{\"count\":2,\"items\":[\"large full-body main mecha illustration on the left\",\"smaller full-body rear or alternate standing view near the middle\"]},\"left_column\":{\"count\":4,\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"introductory Japanese lore text\",\"content\":\"several short lines explaining the military role and high mobility of the unit\"},{\"title\":\"基本仕様\",\"content\":\"specification table with model number, full height, weight, generator output, armor material, sensor range and crew\"},{\"title\":\"カラーリング（標準）\",\"content\":\"color swatch table with 6 swatches: main color A, main color B, sub color, sensor/emission color, warning/orange, joints/frame\"},{\"title\":\"バリエーション\",\"count\":3,\"labels\":[\"標準型\",\"指揮官型\",\"強襲型\"],\"content\":\"three small full-body variant silhouettes at the bottom left\"}]},\"top_middle\":{\"count\":2,\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"機体コンセプト\",\"content\":\"boxed Japanese bullet list describing versatility, mass-production operation, modular equipment, high mobility and close-to-mid range combat\"},{\"title\":\"分解構造図\",\"content\":\"exploded view diagram of the mecha with callout leader lines\",\"parts_count\":14,\"part_labels\":[\"頭部ユニット（センサー／演算中枢）\",\"ショルダーモジュール\",\"コアフレーム\",\"アームユニット\",\"腰部アーマー\",\"フロントアーマー\",\"レッグユニット\",\"ブースター・スラスター\",\"バックパック（エネルギー中継部）\",\"姿勢制御フィン\",\"リアスカート（可動）\",\"エネルギー結晶体（補助動力源）\",\"足部ユニット\",\"halo ring assembly\"]}]},\"right_column\":{\"count\":3,\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"武装・装備\",\"count\":5,\"labels\":[\"多目的ライフル\",\"短距離機関砲\",\"防御シールド\",\"光刃剣（エネルギーブレード）\",\"投擲式エネルギー杭\"],\"content\":\"weapons displayed separately as clean orthographic product renders, including a long sci-fi rifle, compact pistol, ornate shield, purple-bladed sword, and a purple energy projectile streak\"},{\"title\":\"オプション装備例\",\"count\":5,\"labels\":[\"追加肩部ブースター\",\"追加背部ユニット\",\"強化型レッグユニット\",\"支援ユニット（修復用ドローン）\",\"small circular drone unit\"],\"content\":\"five optional equipment modules arranged in a compact grid\"},{\"title\":\"エネルギーシステム（ファンタジーSF要素）\",\"content\":\"diagram of a purple crystal energy core connected to a mechanical ring unit with glowing cables and arcane sci-fi energy trails\"}]},\"bottom_row\":{\"count\":5,\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"バリエーション\",\"count\":3,\"labels\":[\"標準型\",\"指揮官型\",\"強襲型\"]},{\"title\":\"バックパックバリエーション\",\"count\":6,\"labels\":[\"標準バックパック\",\"高機動型\",\"重火力支援型\",\"長距離航行型\",\"ステルス型\",\"補助推進ユニット\"]},{\"title\":\"内部フレーム構造\",\"count\":2,\"labels\":[\"front internal skeletal frame\",\"rear internal skeletal frame\"]},{\"title\":\"可動ギミック\",\"count\":6,\"labels\":[\"肩部可動\",\"肘部可動\",\"膝部可動\",\"腰部可動\",\"足首可動\",\"スカート可動\"],\"content\":\"six close-up articulation panels with red arrows showing joint motion\"},{\"title\":\"コックピット\",\"content\":\"cutaway cockpit pod with dark blue lighting, pilot seat, controls and tiny human scale silhouette\"}]},\"composition_rules\":\"Make the board dense but organized, with exact panel divisions, Japanese captions, fine leader lines, small shadows under objects, no clutter outside the sheet, and consistent industrial design language across all views.\",\"quality\":\"ultra-detailed mecha reference sheet, production art, sharp focus, high resolution, readable layout, professional anime SF concept design\",\"customization\":{\"faction\":\"{argument name=\\\"faction name\\\" default=\\\"帝国軍・正規量産シリーズ\\\"}\",\"energy_color\":\"{argument name=\\\"energy glow color\\\" default=\\\"violet purple\\\"}\"}}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18169.jpg"]},{"i":10152,"text":"{\"type\":\"futuristic anime mecha design specification sheet\",\"style\":\"highly detailed Japanese sci-fi military concept art, clean industrial product-sheet layout, white and pale gray background, thin gray dividers, realistic cel-shaded rendering, dark navy armored humanoid robot with black mechanical joints, gold trim lines, cyan glowing sensors, small decals and warning markings, crisp technical illustration, generated as a complete model-kit reference sheet\",\"language_and_text\":\"Use Japanese section headers and labels throughout the sheet, with large Roman model name text on the left.\",\"main_subject\":{\"faction_header\":\"{argument name=\\\"faction header\\\" default=\\\"共和国軍 量産型機動兵装\\\"}\",\"model_name\":\"{argument name=\\\"model name\\\" default=\\\"ARX-07Fenrir\\\"}\",\"japanese_name\":\"{argument name=\\\"Japanese subtitle\\\" default=\\\"フェンリル\\\"}\",\"faction\":\"{argument name=\\\"faction name\\\" default=\\\"共和国軍 制式採用機\\\"}\",\"appearance\":\"mass-produced heavy mobile weapon, broad rounded shoulder armor, bulky segmented legs, compact helmet-like head with visor, antenna, cyan mono-eye and chest lights, front and rear full-body views shown as the centerpiece\",\"color_scheme\":{\"main_color\":\"{argument name=\\\"main armor color\\\" default=\\\"deep navy blue\\\"}\",\"secondary\":\"charcoal black inner frame\",\"trim\":\"bronze gold panel lining\",\"glow\":\"cyan turquoise optics and vents\",\"weathering\":\"subtle scratches, edge highlights, metallic shading\"}},\"layout\":{\"canvas\":\"wide 16:9 technical reference board divided into multiple labeled panels\",\"left_panel\":{\"position\":\"left third\",\"contents\":[\"large title block with faction crest and model name\",\"short Japanese description paragraphs\",\"基本仕様 table with 8 specification rows: 型式番号 ARX-07Fenrir, 全高 18.3m, 空虚重量 59.4t, 全備重量 81.7t, 出力 2,050kw, 推進機関 多軸式プラズマスラスター, 操縦者 共和国軍（低軌道）, 武装 multi-beam rifle, 110mm rail cannon, defensive energy shield, close-combat energy spear type\" ,\"カラーリング（標準） swatch legend with 6 colors: メインカラー, サブカラーA, サブカラーB, アクセント, センサー/発光部, 警告・マーキング\"]},\"centerpiece\":{\"position\":\"center-left\",\"count\":2,\"views\":[\"front three-quarter standing ARX-07Fenrir holding a long rifle downward in the right hand\",\"rear view labeled REAR showing backpack thrusters, rear armor plating, leg mechanisms and circular cyan exhaust ports\"]},\"top_middle_panels\":[{\"title\":\"機体コンセプト\",\"position\":\"upper middle\",\"content\":\"compact Japanese paragraph explaining the concept of a high-mobility mass-production armored weapon\"},{\"title\":\"分解構造図\",\"position\":\"upper center-right\",\"count\":14,\"description\":\"exploded assembly diagram of the mecha with separated armor, head, torso, arms, legs, backpack and weapons around a black internal frame\",\"labels\":[\"頭部ユニット\",\"視覚・通信モジュール\",\"胸部コアフレーム\",\"腰部装甲\",\"肩部ユニット\",\"上腕アーマー\",\"前腕アーマー\",\"ハンドユニット\",\"脚部アーマー\",\"リアスカート\",\"大型アーマー\",\"機動部ユニット\",\"下腿アーマー\",\"脚部スラスター\"]}],\"right_panels\":[{\"title\":\"武装・装備\",\"position\":\"upper right\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"多目的ビームライフル\",\"110mm連装キャノン\",\"防御エネルギーシールド\",\"近接戦闘用エネルギーヴレイブ\"]},{\"title\":\"オプション装備（換装例）\",\"position\":\"middle right\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"高機動スラスターック\",\"増設ユニット\",\"新型推進ユニット\",\"長距離狙撃アンテナ\"]}],\"bottom_row_sections\":[{\"title\":\"バリエーション\",\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"標準機\",\"指揮官機\",\"重火力支援機\",\"偵察/強襲機\"],\"description\":\"four small full-body variant silhouettes, each with slightly different weapons, shoulders, backpack or head details\"},{\"title\":\"バックパックバリエーション\",\"position\":\"bottom center-left\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"標準バックパック\",\"強力強化型\",\"長距離推進型\",\"高出力兵装対応型\"]},{\"title\":\"内部フレーム構造\",\"position\":\"bottom center\",\"count\":2,\"items\":[\"front inner skeleton view\",\"rear inner skeleton view\"]},{\"title\":\"可動ギミック\",\"position\":\"bottom center-right\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"頭部可動\",\"肘部可動\",\"股関節可動\",\"足首可動\"],\"description\":\"close-up mechanical articulation examples for head, elbow, hip and ankle\"},{\"title\":\"コックピット\",\"position\":\"bottom right-center\",\"count\":2,\"items\":[\"small hatch/module piece\",\"open futuristic pilot cockpit seat with wraparound control consoles and cyan screens\"]},{\"title\":\"マーキング例\",\"position\":\"far bottom right\",\"count\":6,\"items\":[\"共和国軍 共通マーク crest\", \"shield emblem\", \"07 ARX number decal\", \"02 AP number decal\", \"yellow caution triangle\", \"red-white maintenance stencil\"]}],\"footer\":\"tiny Japanese disclaimer line along the bottom edge\"},\"composition_requirements\":\"Ensure the sheet looks like an official mecha model design bible: precise panel borders, lots of readable-looking Japanese microtext, consistent scale across diagrams, sharp mechanical detail, no humans, no environment, no motion blur.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18170.jpg"]},{"i":10153,"text":"Create a photorealistic lifestyle image of a cute compact hatchback car in {argument name=\"car color\" default=\"pale mint green\"} parked in a seaside parking lot on a bright sunny day. The car is shown in full side view, facing right, with the front passenger door open to reveal a warm beige leather interior with wood-toned trim and a rounded modern dashboard. A young blonde woman stands casually in front of the open door, one hand on her hip, wearing a light mint cardigan over a short white floral summer romper and brown sandals; her face is softly anonymized and featureless. The setting is a clean asphalt coastal parking area with white painted parking lines, several other parked cars in the background, tropical plants and palms at the edges, and a vivid turquoise ocean beyond the road. Add distant green mountains and small islands across the horizon under a clear pale blue sky with a few soft clouds. Use a cheerful, cute, aspirational travel aesthetic, realistic reflections on the glossy car paint, crisp daylight shadows, wide-angle composition, high detail, natural colors, and the feeling of wanting a beloved custom-colored car for a beach trip.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18172.jpg"]},{"i":10154,"text":"{\"type\":\"single-page vertical 3:4 Japanese manga comic\",\"style\":\"cute modern anime manga, clean thick black panel borders, expressive chibi-leaning schoolgirl character, flat cel shading, soft pastel backgrounds, cohesive character and background style, high readability, printed comic look\",\"format\":{\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4 portrait\",\"page_layout\":\"five-panel comic page with black gutters and white outer margin\",\"reading_direction\":\"right-to-left manga feel, but arranged visually as a page\"},\"main_character\":{\"description\":\"a teenage Japanese schoolgirl with pale skin, shoulder-length slightly messy black hair, heavy side bangs, large sleepy half-lidded eyes, small mouth, wearing a navy school blazer, white shirt, red ribbon bow tie, seated or standing depending on panel\",\"name\":\"{argument name=\\\"character name\\\" default=\\\"unnamed schoolgirl\\\"}\",\"uniform\":\"{argument name=\\\"school uniform\\\" default=\\\"navy blazer, white shirt, red ribbon bow tie\\\"}\"},\"setting\":\"{argument name=\\\"restaurant setting\\\" default=\\\"McDonald's-style fast food restaurant with red counter, menu screens, burger and fries graphics, trays, drink cup, burger, and fries\\\"}\",\"dialogue\":\"Use vertical Japanese manga speech bubbles and thought bubbles with the following visible dialogue and sound effects: {argument name=\\\"Japanese dialogue text\\\" default=\\\"お財布の中は・・・うーん / ごそごそ / えーっと、チーズバーガーのセットをください / ポテトもつけたいけど、お金が・・・ / ここは我慢するべき？いや、でも・・・ / よし！つけちゃおう！ / ピコーン / うーん・・・どうしよう・・・\\\"}\",\"panels\":{\"count\":5,\"arrangement\":[{\"panel\":1,\"position\":\"top left\",\"description\":\"The schoolgirl sits at a table by a window, opens a brown wallet, and looks worried while checking inside; a vertical thought bubble is on the left and a small rustling sound effect appears near her head.\"},{\"panel\":2,\"position\":\"top right\",\"description\":\"At a fast-food counter, the schoolgirl faces away while ordering from a cheerful cashier wearing a black cap with a yellow M-like logo; overhead menu boards show illustrated burger, fries, and drink sets; a tall vertical speech bubble is on the right.\"},{\"panel\":3,\"position\":\"middle wide panel\",\"description\":\"Close-up of the schoolgirl thinking with one finger on her lips and narrowed eyes; on the left is a floating red fries carton with golden fries and emphasis marks, on the right is a floating purple coin purse thought icon with a small puff; two vertical thought bubbles frame her indecision.\"},{\"panel\":4,\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"description\":\"The schoolgirl sits happily at a table with a tray containing exactly three food items: one drink cup with straw, one cheeseburger, and one red carton of fries; she smiles widely, blushes, raises one index finger, and clenches her other fist, with bright excitement marks and a sound effect.\"},{\"panel\":5,\"position\":\"bottom right\",\"description\":\"The schoolgirl sits alone at a table against a blue background, again touching her chin with a doubtful half-lidded expression and a sweat drop, repeating the indecision joke with a vertical speech bubble and blue elongated thinking sound effect.\"}]},\"props_and_counts\":{\"comic_panels\":5,\"recurring_main_character_appearances\":5,\"fast_food_tray_items_in_final_food_panel\":3,\"visible_order_counter_staff\":1,\"major_speech_or_thought_bubbles\":7,\"floating_thought_icons_in_middle_panel\":2},\"visual_requirements\":\"Keep all characters consistent across panels, with the same face, hairstyle, and uniform. Use rounded expressive eyes, simple noses, small mouths, blush marks where appropriate, manga motion lines, colored sound effects, and clean legible vertical lettering. Avoid photorealism; make it look like a polished social-media manga panel generated from text only.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18173.jpg"]},{"i":10155,"text":"Create a bright, photorealistic lifestyle image of a cute compact retro electric car in a soft pastel {argument name=\"car color\" default=\"mint green\"}, parked in a seaside parking lot on a sunny day. The car has a rounded beetle-like body, circular headlights, smooth glossy paint, cream leather interior, small chrome details, whitewall-style tires, rounded hubcaps, a blank front license plate, and subtle brown trim accents along the lower grille and side sill. A young woman with {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"short blonde bob hair\"} stands casually beside the passenger side, leaning lightly near the door with relaxed posture; her face is softly obscured or featureless. She wears a {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"pale mint short-sleeve cardigan over a cream romper with white strappy sandals\"}, matching the car’s gentle pastel aesthetic. The background shows a vivid turquoise ocean, distant green coastline and hills, blue sky with small white clouds, a low metal guardrail, parking space lines, curb stones, and a leafy tree branch in the upper right corner. Use natural midday sunlight, crisp shadows, clean commercial photography composition, 3/4 front view of the car, cheerful summer mood, realistic proportions, high detail, 4:3 landscape framing.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18174.jpg"]},{"i":10156,"text":"Create a photorealistic lifestyle image of a cute compact retro-futuristic electric hatchback in {argument name=\"car color\" default=\"pale mint green\"} parked on a sunny coastal road beside a sparkling blue ocean. A young woman with {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"short blonde\"} hair stands leaning casually against the passenger side near the front door, wearing a {argument name=\"outfit color\" default=\"light mint green\"} short summer dress with a matching cardigan and beige platform sandals; her face is softly anonymized/blurred. The car has rounded bubble-like styling, smooth glossy paint, large rounded windows, cream interior seats, a brown steering wheel and dashboard, covered rear wheel arches, circular aero wheel covers, subtle chrome trim, and a friendly cute design. Compose the scene in a wide horizontal 3:2 frame with the car filling most of the left and center, the woman on the right, ocean horizon in the background, bright midday sunlight, crisp reflections on the bodywork, shallow realistic depth, clean vacation mood, high-end automotive photography, natural colors, realistic proportions, no text, no logos emphasized.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18175.jpg"]},{"i":10157,"text":"Create a bright, photorealistic vertical lifestyle photo of a young woman standing beside a cute compact hatchback car on a coastal road. The car has a rounded retro-modern body, a glossy two-tone paint scheme with {argument name=\"car color\" default=\"pastel mint green lower panels and creamy white upper body and roof\"}, circular headlights, small silver wheels, beige interior seats, and a charming kawaii-inspired design. The woman has {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"short blonde bob hair\"}, fair skin, a slim build, and wears a coordinated {argument name=\"outfit color\" default=\"pale mint green\"} summer romper with a matching short cardigan and flat strappy sandals; she stands casually in front of the driver-side door with one hand raised near her hair and one leg slightly crossed. Her face is intentionally covered by a soft square beige privacy blur. Set the scene on sunlit asphalt with white parking lines, a low roadside guardrail, vivid blue ocean and clear blue sky in the background, warm midday natural light, gentle shadows, shallow depth of field, clean travel-advertisement mood, realistic camera perspective, high detail, 2:3 portrait composition.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18176.jpg"]},{"i":10158,"text":"{\"type\":\"holographic Japanese fantasy creature trading card\",\"format\":\"landscape collectible game card, 16:9 ratio\",\"style\":\"highly detailed 2D game card illustration, whimsical fantasy monster design, crisp readable Japanese typography, gold pixel-art inspired UI ornaments, premium SSR rarity, rainbow foil background with diagonal prismatic light beams and sparkling starbursts\",\"card_text\":{\"main_title\":\"{argument name=\\\"card title\\\" default=\\\"サバンナ\\\"}\",\"category_block\":{\"position\":\"upper left\",\"lines\":[\"大地生物\",\"身長：不明\",\"体重：不明\"]},\"rarity\":{\"position\":\"upper right\",\"text\":\"SSR\",\"stars_count\":6},\"number\":{\"position\":\"lower left\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"card number\\\" default=\\\"No.07\\\"}\"},\"flavor_text\":{\"position\":\"bottom text box\",\"default\":\"{argument name=\\\"flavor text\\\" default=\\\"大地そのものが目覚める時、敵は知る。逃げ場など、最初から無かったことを。\\\"}\"}},\"main_subject\":{\"creature\":\"a gigantic whale-shaped living landmass creature, half earthy brown cracked stone body and half lush green savanna plateau on its back, small side tail fin visible on the right, tiny legs underneath, cute simple face with two round eyes and a wide horizontal mouth embedded in the grassy hill\",\"mood\":\"absurdly cute yet legendary and powerful\",\"surface_details\":\"grass, shrubs, small trees, dirt cliffs, cracks, pebbles, sweat-drop marks, and miniature wildlife living on the creature's back\"},\"wildlife_on_back\":{\"count\":21,\"items\":[\"1 lion resting near the top center\",\"1 giraffe near the upper right\",\"1 rhinoceros on the right upper hill\",\"2 small white rabbits near the title area\",\"1 small white bird near the upper middle\",\"1 capybara-like animal on the left grass\",\"2 gray elephants near the lower center-left\",\"2 giraffes standing near the lower center-right\",\"2 zebras on the right side\",\"1 hippopotamus lying in a pond at the lower right\",\"1 crocodile or lizard-like animal near the pond\",\"1 small rabbit at the lower left edge\",\"1 small dark rodent on the exposed earth lower left\",\"4 tiny meerkat or prairie-dog figures scattered around the right side\"],\"vegetation\":\"many rounded acacia-like trees and bushes around the perimeter and across the plateau\"},\"layout\":{\"border\":\"thick ornate metallic gold frame with beveled corners, black inner outline, decorative filigree clusters in all four corners\",\"top_nameplate\":\"black and gold plaque centered at the top behind the title\",\"bottom_panel\":\"cream parchment-like rectangular flavor text box with gold frame, black Japanese text, and a separate dark gold number tab on the left\",\"background\":\"dark rainbow holographic foil with multicolor diagonal streaks, lens-flare sparkles, and high contrast collectible-card shine\",\"watermark\":\"small white Vidu AI watermark at bottom right\"},\"rendering_requirements\":\"make every Japanese label sharp and legible, emphasize glossy gold highlights, SSR premium rarity, dramatic sparkle effects, and a playful monster-encyclopedia card feel\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18177.jpg"]},{"i":10159,"text":"{\"type\":\"side-by-side anime character and collectible trading card design\",\"canvas\":\"wide horizontal composition on a clean white background, split visually into two main objects with generous spacing\",\"style\":\"high-detail Japanese fantasy card game aesthetic mixed with chibi anime character art, crisp black linework, saturated colors, ornate metallic gold decoration, deep navy and black palette, dramatic lightning and castle background on the card\",\"left_object\":{\"position\":\"left half\",\"description\":\"one full-body chibi samurai warlord mascot standing alone on white, confident slight smirk, large head and small body proportions, spiky wild {argument name=\\\"hair color\\\" default=\\\"crimson red with black shadow accents\\\"} hair fanning backward, sharp eyebrows, pale skin, narrow determined eyes\",\"outfit_count\":7,\"outfit_pieces\":[\"orange inner kimono top\",\"dark gray outer robe\",\"bright royal blue sleeveless haori panels\",\"wide navy waist sash tied at front\",\"black pleated hakama-style lower garment\",\"black gloves or armored sleeves\",\"black sandals with brown soles\"],\"pose\":\"front-facing three-quarter stance, arms slightly bent at the sides, feet apart, heroic and compact\"},\"right_object\":{\"position\":\"right half\",\"description\":\"one ornate vertical fantasy trading card featuring the same chibi character centered inside a richly decorated frame\",\"card_shape\":\"portrait rectangle with rounded corners and black outer border\",\"card_frame\":\"intricate embossed gold filigree, navy enamel panels, samurai crest motifs, clouds, tassels, corner ornaments, and premium foil-like highlights\",\"background_scene\":\"dark blue Japanese castle at night with golden sparks, storm clouds, lightning, and battlefield energy behind the character\",\"top_area\":{\"count\":4,\"elements\":[{\"label\":\"薩摩の知勇・不敗の名将\",\"description\":\"small gold subtitle centered above the name\"},{\"label\":\"島津 義久\",\"description\":\"large main character name in gold Japanese calligraphy\"},{\"label\":\"極 / LEGEND\",\"description\":\"rarity badge at upper right\"},{\"label\":\"five gold stars\",\"description\":\"star rating row beneath the rarity badge\"}]},\"left_vertical_banner\":{\"count\":1,\"label\":\"鬼島津の才略、戦場を支配す\",\"description\":\"vertical Japanese flavor text on a dark hanging plaque with gold trim\"},\"right_vertical_banner\":{\"count\":1,\"label\":\"智勇兼備・戦術大将\",\"description\":\"vertical Japanese ability/class text on a dark hanging plaque with gold trim\"},\"center_art\":{\"description\":\"the same chibi samurai with {argument name=\\\"character name\\\" default=\\\"島津 義久\\\"} design, standing in front of the castle, robe flaring outward, red hair and blue haori matching the separate character art\"},\"bottom_stats\":{\"count\":5,\"labels\":[\"総合力 98\",\"統率 97\",\"武勇 93\",\"知略 96\",\"政治 95\"],\"description\":\"five numeric stat boxes in a horizontal gold-bordered row\"},\"bottom_text_panels\":{\"count\":3,\"panels\":[{\"title\":\"特性\",\"heading\":\"鬼島津の采配\",\"description\":\"left ability text panel with small Japanese explanatory text\"},{\"title\":\"奥義\",\"heading\":\"義久の神算\",\"description\":\"right ability text panel with small Japanese explanatory text and a glowing blue circular emblem\"},{\"title\":\"戦国大名\",\"description\":\"bottom biography strip with Japanese lore text and card number No.017 at the lower right\"}]},\"emblems_count\":3,\"emblems\":[\"large circular Shimazu cross crest at top left\",\"smaller circular Shimazu cross crest above the stats\",\"glowing blue crest orb at lower right\"]},\"rendering_instructions\":\"Generate a polished mockup that looks like an original collectible samurai card game asset, with readable Japanese typography, ultra-ornate gold borders, a premium legendary card finish, and a clean comparison layout showing the standalone mascot illustration beside the finished card. Use the visible card number {argument name=\\\"card number\\\" default=\\\"No.017\\\"}, rarity {argument name=\\\"rarity label\\\" default=\\\"極 LEGEND\\\"}, and overall stat {argument name=\\\"overall power\\\" default=\\\"98\\\"}.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18178.jpg"]}];